profile kaggle-t4: qwen2.5-3b at nf4, gsm8k
  The bulk-data machine AND, measured rather than assumed, a valid measurement device: a T4 clears CLEAR's 10% bar at 2.3% rel std dev once the window is sized to its ~100 ms sensor period. The 70 W cap seems to help -- a pinned card does not oscillate. ~30 h/week dwarfs every other budget here. Pass --energy.

